    "text": "On 2038-04-17, the Morrowglass lens line rejected 52 prisms from lot `MX-7Q`. Cross-section microscopy confirmed that mica inclusions caused 21 of 52 rejections. The cause of the other 31 rejections remains unconfirmed.\n\nDuring the same 18-minute interval, spindle speed increased from 740 rpm to 910 rpm, while fracture alarms increased from 3 to 16. The evidence neither confirms that the spindle-speed change caused the alarm increase nor rules out the change as a contributing cause. Solvent carryover was ruled out as a cause of the alarm increase.",
